{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56102","headline":"奉戒赞 · 杜光庭","name":"奉戒赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉戒爲身宝，永劫享灵期。\n虚心会虚寂，精感在精思。\n九鸾陪玉轶，八凤荐金芝。\n青童歌妙曲，玄女唱清词。\n神尊示光景，太上湛希夷。\n天华杂香起，法雨散灵滋。\n勤苦修生道，翘想作仙基。\n精诚如不怠，鹤驾自当之。\n（以上十七首，均见《正统道藏》本杜光庭《太上三洞传授道德经紫虚籙拜表仪》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}